---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro'
import { waLink, mailLink } from '../../data/contact'

// Before/after demo for real-estate agencies (Costa del Sol pilot). Shared by link only.
// Solvista Estates is a fictional demonstration agency; the chat and the lead alert below
// are real output from the live demo, not mockups.
const chatUrl = 'https://demo.klantkraan.nl/?client=solvista-demo'
---

<Base
  title="The 9pm enquiry — live real-estate receptionist demo"
  description="See the same evening twice: a portal enquiry that waits until morning, and the same enquiry answered, qualified and flagged hot within five minutes."
  lang="en"
  centered={false}
  stickyCta={false}
  noindex={true}
>
  <!-- 1. Hero -->
  <section class="py-8 md:py-14">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
        <h1 class="font-display text-h1 md:text-hero text-(--color-chalk)">
          The <span class="text-(--color-sodium)">9pm enquiry</span> that decides who sells the apartment.
        </h1>
        <span
          class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-(--color-panel) px-3 py-1 eyebrow"
        >
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-(--color-sodium)"></span> Live demo
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-body md:text-h3 text-(--color-dim)">
        Buyers browse the portals after dinner, and they write to more than one agency. Below is the
        same Tuesday evening twice: once as it usually goes, and once with Emma, a digital
        receptionist for real-estate agencies. Then try her yourself.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. Before / after -->
  <section class="border-y border-(--color-line) bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.14)] py-10 md:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <!-- Before -->
        <div
          class="rounded-(--radius-card) border border-(--color-line) bg-(--color-panel) p-6 md:p-8"
        >
          <p class="eyebrow">Tonight, without cover</p>
          <div class="mt-5 space-y-5">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-4">
              <span class="font-display text-small text-(--color-dim)">21:04</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-body text-(--color-chalk)">
                  A portal enquiry lands in the office inbox: "Hi, is the 2-bed in Estepona still
                  available? We're in the area until Thursday."
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-4">
              <span class="font-display text-small text-(--color-dim)">21:05</span>
              <p class="text-body text-(--color-dim)">
                Nothing. The office closed at 18:30. The buyer sends the same message to two other
                agencies with similar listings.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-4">
              <span class="font-display text-small text-(--color-dim)">09:30</span>
              <p class="text-body text-(--color-dim)">
                Next morning, someone works through the inbox and replies.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-4">
              <span class="font-display text-small text-(--color-dim)">09:41</span>
              <p class="text-body text-(--color-chalk)">
                "Thanks, we've already arranged a viewing through another agency."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- After -->
        <div
          class="rounded-(--radius-card) border border-(--color-line) border-l-[3px] border-l-(--color-sodium) bg-(--color-panel) p-6 md:p-8"
        >
          <p class="eyebrow">The same evening, with Emma</p>
          <div class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-body">
            <p class="rounded-(--radius-button) bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.22)] px-4 py-2 text-(--color-dim)">
              Hi! I'm looking to buy an apartment on the Costa del Sol.
            </p>
            <p
              class="rounded-(--radius-button) bg-[rgba(255,184,77,0.08)] px-4 py-2 text-(--color-chalk)"
            >
              Hi! Great to help. Which towns or areas are you considering?
            </p>
            <p class="text-small text-(--color-dim)">
              Emma asks one thing at a time: towns, budget, bedrooms, must-haves. Then she searches
              the agency's own inventory and answers with real listings.
            </p>
            <p
              class="rounded-(--radius-button) bg-[rgba(255,184,77,0.08)] px-4 py-2 text-(--color-chalk)"
            >
              I found two options in Estepona: SV-1001, a 2-bed apartment at €189,000 with communal
              pool and sea views… Do either of these appeal to you?
            </p>
            <p class="text-small text-(--color-dim)">
              She asks when they want to move and how they're funding it, and takes a name and
              number. Five minutes after the enquiry, the agent's phone buzzes:
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- The actual Telegram alert this conversation produced -->
          <div
            class="mt-4 rounded-(--radius-button) border border-(--color-line) bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.22)] p-4 font-mono text-small text-(--color-chalk)"
          >
            <p>
              [Solvista Estates] 🔥 HOT buyer lead for Maria: Anna Keller (anna.keller@example.com)
            </p>
            <p class="mt-1">Looking for: sale, Estepona/Marbella, up to €300,000, 2+ beds</p>
            <p class="mt-1">Matches: SV-1001</p>
            <p class="mt-1">
              Notes: Wants apartment with pool. Cash buyer, move within 3 months. Liked SV-1001.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-body text-(--color-dim)">
            A cash buyer moving within three months, flagged hot the same hour. Following up first
            is now a decision, not luck.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-small text-(--color-dim)">
        Solvista Estates is a demonstration agency with sample inventory. The chat lines and the
        lead alert above are real output from the live demo below, not a mockup.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. Try it live -->
  <section class="py-10 md:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
      <p class="eyebrow">Try it yourself</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-h1 text-(--color-chalk)">Play the 9pm buyer.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-body text-(--color-dim)">
        The same receptionist, live, on the demonstration agency's inventory. She answers in
        English, Spanish, German or Dutch.
      </p>
      <a href={chatUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mt-6 btn btn-primary btn-lg">
        <Icon name="message-circle" class="h-5 w-5" />
        <span>Start the chat demo</span>
      </a>
      <div class="mt-10 divide-y divide-(--color-line) border-y border-(--color-line)">
        <article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-start gap-5 md:gap-6 py-6 md:py-8">
          <Icon name="message-square" class="mt-1 h-7 w-7 text-(--color-sodium)" />
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-h3 text-(--color-chalk)">Buy</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-body text-(--color-dim)">
              "Looking for a 2-bed apartment in Estepona up to €300,000." She qualifies you, shows
              matching listings from the inventory, and routes you to the right agent.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-start gap-5 md:gap-6 py-6 md:py-8">
          <Icon name="calendar-check" class="mt-1 h-7 w-7 text-(--color-sodium)" />
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-h3 text-(--color-chalk)">Sell</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-body text-(--color-dim)">
              "I want to sell my villa in Marbella." She takes the address and reads it back, asks
              about the property, and books the free valuation in the diary.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-start gap-5 md:gap-6 py-6 md:py-8">
          <Icon name="phone" class="mt-1 h-7 w-7 text-(--color-sodium)" />
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-h3 text-(--color-chalk)">Rent</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-body text-(--color-dim)">
              "A furnished 2-bed in Marbella, up to €1,700 a month." She finds it, asks your move-in
              date, and books the viewing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-start gap-5 md:gap-6 py-6 md:py-8">
          <Icon name="message-circle" class="mt-1 h-7 w-7 text-(--color-sodium)" />
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-h3 text-(--color-chalk)">Switch language mid-chat</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-body text-(--color-dim)">
              Start in English, carry on in Spanish or German. She follows without being asked.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. Honesty + CTA -->
  <section class="border-y border-(--color-line) bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.14)] py-10 md:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6">
      <div
        class="rounded-(--radius-card) border border-(--color-line) border-l-[3px] border-l-(--color-sodium) bg-(--color-panel) p-6 md:p-8"
      >
        <h2 class="font-display text-h2 text-(--color-sodium)">Honest by design</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body text-(--color-dim)">
          Emma opens every conversation by saying she is a digital assistant, as the EU AI Act
          requires. She only presents listings from your inventory, quotes prices exactly as they
          are, and never values a property or gives legal or mortgage advice. Your agents keep the
          conversations that matter.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="font-display text-h1 text-(--color-chalk)">Want this on your own listings?</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-body text-(--color-dim)">
          This demo runs on sample inventory. Connected to your own feed, Emma answers with your
          listings, routes leads to your agents by area and language, and flags the hot ones the
          same hour. Prepared by Klantkraan.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 btn-row">
          <a href={waLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            <Icon name="message-circle" class="h-5 w-5" />
            <span>WhatsApp us</span>
          </a>
          <a href={mailLink} class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Rather by e-mail</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
